WEBVTT

00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:20,020
is sausage made without nitrates or nitrates or nitrites, okay, they usually still add cell

00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:28,500
results. So cell result has natural nitrites in it. It acts as a preservative, that's why they

00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:35,940
add it to different meats. And some people, you could read different blog posts about this, some people

00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:41,940
say it's still not good for you because it's nitrites. I don't fall into that category. I think

00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:50,580
celery salt is a natural form of how can you preserve meat, and I think you're just fine with that.

00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:56,740
So yes, you want sausage, preferably made without nitrites, sulfide, solid kind of stuff.

00:00:58,340 --> 00:01:04,420
So it's as natural as possible, organic if possible. Yes, they're going to add celery salt as a

00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:13,540
preservative, and I think that's just fine.

